  "details": "I simply want to adjust my X, Y and Z rotation manually instead of having to finesse my body into weird shapes just to be perfectly facing the way I want in the position I want.\nFor example, right now it is quite impossible to lay on your back and reasonably finesse yourself from that position to look like you're laying on your stomach, when you could easily do that with a single axis 180 degree rotation with manual control, that or laying on your back and having your body be sideways, as if laying on your side, since you can't reasonably lay on your side with an Index unless you want to break the speakers on the sides.",
